    "text_instructions": [
      {
        "content": [
          "### HCP Reach Definition\n",
          "HCP reach = COUNT(DISTINCT npi) across both hcp_interactions and digital_engagements tables. To calculate, combine both tables using UNION before counting distinct NPIs.\n",
          "\n",
          "### Net Revenue Definition\n",
          "Net revenue is the actual revenue retained by the company after all price adjustments. Calculate as: SUM(amount) WHERE transaction_type = 'gross_payment' minus SUM(amount) WHERE transaction_type IN ('rebate', 'chargeback', 'return'). This represents gross revenue minus all reductions.\n",
          "\n",
          "### Copay Exclusion from Net Revenue\n",
          "Copay transactions must be excluded from net revenue calculations. Copay is the patient's out-of-pocket payment, not company revenue. When calculating net revenue, only use transaction types: gross_payment (add), rebate (subtract), chargeback (subtract), and return (subtract). Never include copay in revenue metrics."
        ],
        "id": "01f185bd98f91b05ba2b5da9123bc963"
      }
    ]
